messages:  ['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 386392332 and 491799586? Please reason step by step.\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of adding 386392332 and 491799586, we can follow these steps:\n\n1. **Align the numbers by their place values**: This ensures that we are adding the digits in the same place values together. Both numbers have 8 digits, so we can align them vertically:\n\n   ```\n   386392332\n   +491799586\n   ```\n\n2. **Add the digits starting from the rightmost (units place)**: We start by adding the units place digits:\n   - 2 (from 386392332) + 6 (from 491799586) = 8\n\n3. **Move to the next place value (tens place)**: Next, we add the tens place digits:\n   - 3 (from 386392332) + 8 (from 491799586) = 11\n   - Write down 1 and carry over 1 to the next place value (hundreds place).\n\n4. **Continue adding the digits in the hundreds place**:\n   - 2 (from 386392332) + 9 (from 491799586) + 1 (carried over) = 12\n   - Write down 2 and carry over 1 to the next place value (thousands place).\n\n5. **Add the digits in the thousands place**:\n   - 3 (from 386392332) + 9 (from 491799586) + 1 (carried over) = 13\n   - Write down 3 and carry over 1 to the next place value (ten-thousands place).\n\n6. **Continue adding the digits in the ten-thousands place**:\n   - 9 (from 386392332) + 7 (from 491799586) + 1 (carried over) = 17\n   - Write down 7 and carry over 1 to the next place value (hundred-thousands place).\n\n7. **Add the digits in the hundred-thousands place**:\n   - 6 (from 386392332) + 1 (from 491799586) + 1 (carried over) = 8\n   - Write down 8.\n\n8. **Continue adding the digits in the million place**:\n   - 8 (from 386392332) + 9 (from 491799586) = 17\n   - Write down 7 and carry over 1 to the next place value (ten-million place).\n\n9. **Add the digits in the ten-million place**:\n   - 8 (from 386392332) + 4 (from 491799586) + 1 (carried over) = 13\n   - Write down 3 and carry over 1 to the next place value (hundred-million place).\n\n10. **Add the digits in the hundred-million place**:\n    - 3 (from 386392332) + 4 (from 491799586) + 1 (carried over) = 8\n    - Write down 8.\n\n11. **Final result**: After adding all the place values, we get the sum of 386392332 and 491799586.\n\n   ```\n   386392332\n   +491799586\n   ---------\n   878191918\n   ```\n']
