messages:  ['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 682961756 and 978696741? Please reason step by step.\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of adding 682961756 and 978696741, we can follow these steps:\n\n1. **Align the numbers by their place values**: This ensures that we are adding the digits in the same place values together. Both numbers have 8 digits, so we can align them vertically:\n\n   ```\n   682961756\n   +978696741\n   ```\n\n2. **Add the digits starting from the rightmost (units place)**: We start by adding the units place digits:\n   - 6 (from 682961756) + 1 (from 978696741) = 7\n\n3. **Move to the next place value (tens place)**: Next, we add the tens place digits:\n   - 5 (from 682961756) + 4 (from 978696741) = 9\n\n4. **Continue this process for each place value**: We move to the hundreds place, thousands place, and so on:\n   - 7 (from 682961756) + 7 (from 978696741) = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1)\n   - 1 (from 682961756) + 6 (from 978696741) + 1 (carry over) = 13 (write down 3 and carry over 1)\n   - 9 (from 682961756) + 9 (from 978696741) + 1 (carry over) = 19 (write down 9 and carry over 1)\n   - 2 (from 682961756) + 8 (from 978696741) + 1 (carry over) = 19 (write down 9 and carry over 1)\n   - 8 (from 682961756) + 7 (from 978696741) + 1 (carry over) = 16 (write down 6 and carry over 1)\n   - 6 (from 682961756) + 6 (from 978696741) + 1 (carry over) = 13 (write down 3 and carry over 1)\n   - 8 (from 682961756) + 7 (from 978696741) + 1 (carry over) = 16 (write down 6 and carry over 1)\n   - 6 (from 682961756) + 9 (from 978696741) + 1 (carry over) = 16 (write down 6 and carry over 1)\n\n5. **Combine the results**: After adding all the place values, we get the final sum:\n   ```\n   682961756\n   +978696741\n   ---------\n   1661658497\n   ```\n']
