      "index": 0,
      "text": " Now, we add the numbers column by column from right to left:\n- Units place: 0 + 4 = 4\n- Tens place: 2 + 9 = 11 (write down 1, carry over 1)\n- Hundreds place: 4 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 12 (write down 2, carry over 1)\n- Thousands place: 1 + 4 + 3 + 1 (carried over) = 9\n- Ten thousands place: 7 + 0 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 8\n- Hundred thousands place: 2 + 0 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 3\n- Millions place: 7 + 9 + 1 (carried over) = 17\n- Ten millions place: 1 + 6 = 7\nSo, the sum is:\n```\n  17,274,1420\n+ 629,034,794\n-----------\n  706,308,914\n```\nTherefore, the sum of 17,274,1420 and 629,034,794 is 706,308,914.\n</answer>",
